  "pageshortdescription": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "shortDescTitle": "<p>Revolution Cement Mixing and Delivery System</p>\r\n",
    "shortDescTop": "<p>This advanced system requires fewer steps to load, mix and transfer cement. The rotary handpiece reduces variability and results in consistent mix times, while the built-in charcoal filter reduces harmful fumes. Also, the mixing blade provides unmatched mix quality. One edge scrapes the cartridge wall forcing cement to the center, eliminating unmixed powder. The opposite edges smears the cement against the cartridge all, bringing bubbles to the surface and reducing porosity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "Dilara.Atkins@stryker.com",
